      <h1>How Gold Wash Plants <em>Work</em></h1>
      <p>A complete guide to the placer gold recovery process. Understand how our all-in-one wash plants achieve 95-98% gold recovery rates using simple gravity separation — no mercury, no chemicals.</p>
